{%- comment -%}
  Florista delivery page — /pages/delivery, built 2026-08-28. See docs/design-log.md.

  The one page that replaced the four cut Wix city pages (site-structure.md §3.3): every area
  served, with its real fee, plus the same-day rule. Shape chosen by the owner from three options —
  fee table + how-it-works, not area cards and not a FAQ hybrid.

  Content/design split, per the standing rule:
    - The DESIGN is here and in florista-delivery-page.css.
    - The FEES are section blocks (one per area) and the copy is section settings, so the owner can
      change a price or an area from the theme editor without a deploy.
    - The FALLBACK table below renders the five areas as decided on 2026-08-28, for the case
      where the section has no blocks yet. Fees on this page must match the shipping rates at
      checkout — that cross-check is a Phase 6 item in docs/status.md.

  Areas and fees decided with the owner 2026-08-28, from the live checkout rates: חיפה 30, נשר 35,
  קריות 50 (כולל קרית חיים — excluded from the Haifa zone), טירת הכרמל 50, עתלית 65.
  עכו and נהריה are NOT served — dropped from the business-rule list the same day.

  The phone number is the site-wide theme setting the header and footer already read, so this
  page can never show a different number than the rest of the site.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'florista-delivery-page.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign phone_display = settings.phone_display | default: '054-2270287'
  assign phone_e164 = settings.phone_e164 | default: '+972542270287'

  assign intro = section.settings.intro | default: 'אנחנו שולחים זרים טריים מהחנות שלנו בחיפה — לרוב עוד באותו היום. לאחר ההזמנה נתאם איתכם טלפונית את מסירת המשלוח.'
  assign sameday_heading = section.settings.sameday_heading | default: 'משלוח באותו היום'
  assign sameday_text = section.settings.sameday_text | default: 'הזמנה שנקלטת עד 17:00 יוצאת אליכם עוד באותו היום, בימים א׳–ה׳. בימי שישי וערבי חג המשלוחים מסתיימים לפני כניסת השבת, ובתאריכי שיא ייתכנו שינויים.'
  assign outside_text = section.settings.outside_text | default: 'גרים מחוץ לאזורים האלה? חייגו אלינו ונבדוק יחד —'
  assign cta_label = section.settings.cta_label | default: 'להזמנת פרחים'
  assign cta_url = section.settings.cta_url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url
-%}

<section class="fdp">
  <div class="fdp-inner">
    <h1 class="fdp-title">
      {%- if page.title != blank -%}{{ page.title | escape }}{%- else -%}משלוחי פרחים בחיפה והסביבה{%- endif -%}
    </h1>

    <p class="fdp-intro">{{ intro | escape }}</p>

    <h2 class="fdp-table-heading">{{ section.settings.table_heading | default: 'אזורי המשלוח והמחירים' | escape }}</h2>

    <table class="fdp-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">אזור</th>
          <th scope="col">דמי משלוח</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            <tr {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <th scope="row">{{ block.settings.area | escape }}</th>
              <td class="fdp-fee"><bdi>{{ block.settings.fee | escape }}&nbsp;₪</bdi></td>
            </tr>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          <tr><th scope="row">חיפה</th><td class="fdp-fee"><bdi>30&nbsp;₪</bdi></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">נשר</th><td class="fdp-fee"><bdi>35&nbsp;₪</bdi></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">קריות (כולל קרית חיים)</th><td class="fdp-fee"><bdi>50&nbsp;₪</bdi></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">טירת הכרמל</th><td class="fdp-fee"><bdi>50&nbsp;₪</bdi></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">עתלית</th><td class="fdp-fee"><bdi>65&nbsp;₪</bdi></td></tr>
        {%- endif -%}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="fdp-sameday">
      <svg class="fdp-sameday-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
        <path d="M12 7v5l3 3"></path>
      </svg>
      <div class="fdp-sameday-text">
        <h2 class="fdp-sameday-heading">{{ sameday_heading | escape }}</h2>
        <p>{{ sameday_text | escape }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="fdp-outside">
      {{ outside_text | escape }}
      <a class="fdp-phone" href="tel:{{ phone_e164 }}"><bdi>{{ phone_display }}</bdi></a>
    </p>

    <div class="fdp-cta-row">
      <a class="fdp-cta" href="{{ cta_url }}">{{ cta_label | escape }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%}
  areaServed — added 2026-08-30 from the Google-conformance audit.

  It was missing everywhere: `settings_schema.json` has held the correct five zones under
  `delivery_areas` since the page was built, and nothing referenced it. So the structured data
  said nothing about where we deliver, on the one page that does.

  Two deliberate choices:

  1. **It lives here, not in theme.liquid.** The structured-data policies say not to mark up
     content that is not visible to readers of the page. This is the only page where the areas
     are on screen, so it is the only page where the claim is backed by what a visitor sees.

  2. **It is built from the same source as the visible table**, blocks first and the same
     five-area fallback second — not from `settings.delivery_areas`, which can drift from the
     table without anyone noticing. Schema and screen cannot disagree here by construction.

  The node carries only `@id` and `areaServed`: the `@id` matches the `Florist` node in
  theme.liquid, so consumers merge the two rather than seeing a second business. NAP is not
  repeated. עכו and נהריה are absent because they are absent from the table.

  ⚠️ Since 2026-09-07 `theme.liquid`'s `Florist` node emits `areaServed` too, on every page —
  the delivery areas were invisible to a crawler reading any other page. Because both nodes
  share one `@id` they merge, so the fallback list below and the hard-coded list there must
  stay character-identical: a differently-spelled area does not override, it adds. If you edit
  an area name in a fee row, update `theme.liquid` to match, or the two will disagree on this
  page only. The proper fix — one shared theme setting both read — is not built yet.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture area_served -%}
  {%- assign sep = '' -%}
  {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      {%- if block.settings.area != blank -%}
        {{ sep }}{"@type":"City","name":{{ block.settings.area | strip | json }}}
        {%- assign sep = ',' -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign fallback_areas = 'חיפה,נשר,קריות (כולל קרית חיים),טירת הכרמל,עתלית' | split: ',' -%}
    {%- for area in fallback_areas -%}
      {{ sep }}{"@type":"City","name":{{ area | json }}}
      {%- assign sep = ',' -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if area_served != blank -%}
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Florist",
      "@id": {{ request.origin | append: '/#business' | json }},
      "areaServed": [{{ area_served | strip_newlines | strip }}]
    }
  </script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Florista משלוחים",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "משפט פתיחה",
      "default": "אנחנו שולחים זרים טריים מהחנות שלנו בחיפה — לרוב עוד באותו היום. לאחר ההזמנה נתאם איתכם טלפונית את מסירת המשלוח."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "table_heading",
      "label": "כותרת טבלת המחירים",
      "default": "אזורי המשלוח והמחירים"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "sameday_heading",
      "label": "כותרת — משלוח באותו היום",
      "default": "משלוח באותו היום"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "sameday_text",
      "label": "טקסט — משלוח באותו היום",
      "default": "הזמנה שנקלטת עד 17:00 יוצאת אליכם עוד באותו היום, בימים א׳–ה׳. בימי שישי וערבי חג המשלוחים מסתיימים לפני כניסת השבת, ובתאריכי שיא ייתכנו שינויים."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "outside_text",
      "label": "שורת אזור אחר",
      "default": "גרים מחוץ לאזורים האלה? חייגו אלינו ונבדוק יחד —",
      "info": "מספר הטלפון נלקח אוטומטית מהגדרות ערכת העיצוב — אותו מספר כמו בכותרת ובפוטר."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_label",
      "label": "כפתור — טקסט",
      "default": "להזמנת פרחים"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_url",
      "label": "כפתור — קישור"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "area",
      "name": "אזור משלוח",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "area",
          "label": "שם האזור",
          "default": "חיפה"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fee",
          "label": "דמי משלוח בש\"ח",
          "default": "30",
          "info": "מספר בלבד — סימן ה־₪ מוצג אוטומטית. חייב להתאים לתעריף בצ'קאאוט."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 10,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Florista משלוחים",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "area", "settings": { "area": "חיפה", "fee": "30" } },
        { "type": "area", "settings": { "area": "נשר", "fee": "35" } },
        { "type": "area", "settings": { "area": "קריות (כולל קרית חיים)", "fee": "50" } },
        { "type": "area", "settings": { "area": "טירת הכרמל", "fee": "50" } },
        { "type": "area", "settings": { "area": "עתלית", "fee": "65" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
